    "key_id": "710220540",
    "translation_id": "6571970007",
    "en": "Please provide your SwitchBot app username and password. This data won't be saved and is only used to retrieve device model information to automate discovery. Usernames and passwords are case-sensitive. OAuth sign-in is recommended when available.",
